  "claim_limits": [
    "Intermediate Patch IVV only; not full Upgrade IVVQ.",
    "Fresh Debian 13 observations use the exact signed product package and its attested CLI. Historical observations keep their original identities.",
    "Recognized historical WireGuard states were reconstructed under a relevant hardening subset; not the reporter exact machine or every upgrade chain since v3.",
    "Active historical VPN retirement requires explicit operator selection and independent administrative access. Unknown ownership and custom configurations remain safe refusals.",
    "Controlled archive I/O failure and fresh retry were tested; process-kill and power-loss durability are not claimed.",
    "Geo/ASN was temporarily disabled with approval to isolate WireGuard; the original snapshot, settings and service states were restored and verified.",
    "Operator configuration and lists were explicitly restored from private backups after native purge. Automatic retention across purge is not claimed.",
    "The attested candidate CLI exercised the protected qualification updater; the installed older production updater was not used for that operation.",
    "Earlier platform, service and HA observations retain their original identities. No fresh all-platform lifecycle, HA endurance or broad performance campaign is claimed.",
    "Original nonzero harness captures and their corrections remain in the private input graph; they are not relabeled successful executions."
  ],
